From c6cba76ea04a1b4f25b73a7ea7714de6be3a4064 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Inbae Jeon <inbest@telechips.com>
Date: Tue, 26 Sep 2023 16:31:23 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] [fea] pcie: add PCIe IPC support

- This commit is to support PCIe IPC functionality in
D5/D3/ND.
- PCIe IPC driver has two modes depending on the operation
mode of the pcie controller.
  - Host Controller: Endpoint Mode
  - Endpoint Controller: Endpoint Function Mode
- A virtual net device is added to support PCIe IPC.

Linked Commit:
TCS: SD750XL-639
